## 1. GRANT OF LICENSE

Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, Still Systems, LLC ("Licensor") grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install and use the TreeResolve extension for Visual Studio Code ("Software") strictly in accordance with your designated Subscription Tier:

* **a. Community Tier**: Free, perpetual, limited license to utilize visual 3-way manual diffing and line-level merge conflict inspection.
* **b. Evaluation / Trial Tier**: A 14-day fully featured evaluation license starting from the initial installation date, requiring no financial commitment. Upon expiration of the 14-day evaluation period, this license automatically converts to the perpetual Community Tier unless a Commercial / Pro Tier subscription is active.
* **c. Commercial / Pro Tier**: A paid subscription license granting full access to automated AST semantic resolution, advanced intra-line token alignment, and associated automation tooling.

